ected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"No conflicting identity or format evidence found in reviewed exact-edition and content sources."}],"work_id":1159,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":679,"text":"Gerard Adriaan Heineken legde de basis voor het bierbedrijf dat zijn familienaam wereldwijd bekendmaakte. Annejet van der Zijl reconstrueert zijn leven met behulp van familiearchieven en plaatst het in het negentiende-eeuwse Amsterdam. Ondernemerschap en de culturele opleving van de stad lopen door elkaar. Ook de persoonlijke spanningen achter het zakelijke succes krijgen aandacht in dit portret van de vaak overschaduwde grondlegger.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484217/gerard-heineken.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021400730","key":{"id":1160},"before":{"id":1160,"title":"De Amerikaanse prinses","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789021400730","work_id":1160,"language":null,"publisher":"Em. Querido''s Uitgeverij","created_at":"2026-09-03T19:12:11.921532+00:00","open_library_edition_id":"OL32380036M"},"after":{"id":1160,"title":"De Amerikaanse prinses","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789021400730","work_id":1160,"language":"nld","publisher":"Em. Querido''s Uitgeverij","created_at":"2026-09-03T19:12:11.921532+00:00","open_library_edition_id":"OL32380036M"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021400730","key":{"edition_id":1160},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-004-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/264071/de-amerikaanse-prinses.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/264071/de-amerikaanse-prinses.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-